              "qp": 10
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "<b> </b> <b> </b> Fig. 4.1 shows drawings of photomicrographs of three stages of meiosis in the lily plant, <i>Lilium grandiflorum</i>. Individual chromosomes and their structure <b>cannot</b> be seen clearly.",
