            "caption": "Fig. 4.1",
            "src": "figures/q4_fig4_1.png",
            "alt": "Stages of meiosis",
            "source": {
              "qp": 10
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "<b> </b> <b> </b> Identify the three stages of meiosis shown in Fig. 4.1.",
